    <h1>I build things across borders, then write down what the data alone couldn&rsquo;t tell me.</h1>
    <p class="intro">Hi, I&rsquo;m Sarath. I run international content operations at KukuFM, which right now means launching microdramas in languages they were never written in. <em>Margin of Error</em> is where I think out loud about the work: AI, marketing, media, and the small operational calls that quietly decide whether a thing works. I&rsquo;m wrong a fair amount. The writing is how I narrow the error bars.</p>
    <p class="sig">Mostly case studies. Occasionally arguments. Always specific. &mdash; <b>SCY</b></p>
